<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IMPOSTER Network – Terms & Conditions</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="glass-nav">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <div class="logo">
                <span class="logo-imposter">IMPOSTER</span>
                <span class="logo-network">NETWORK</span>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
                <a href="/cart" class="cart-link">
                    Cart
                    <span class="cart-badge" id="cartCount">0</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/history">History</a>
                <a href="/terms" class="active">Terms</a>
                <% if (user) { %>
                    <a href="/admin" style="<%= isAdmin ? '' : 'display:none;' %>" class="admin-link">Admin</a>
                    <div class="user-menu">
                        <img src="<%= user.avatar || 'https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/0.png' %>" alt="avatar" class="user-avatar">
                        <span class="username"><%= user.username %></span>
                        <a href="/logout" class="logout-btn">Logout</a>
                    </div>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/auth/discord" class="discord-btn">
                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                            <path d="M20.317 4.37a19.791 19.791 0 0 0-4.885-1.515c-.209.377-.456.885-.624 1.3a18.277 18.277 0 0 0-5.487 0 12.64 12.64 0 0 0-.633-1.3 19.736 19.736 0 0 0-4.885 1.515c-2.86 4.27-3.636 8.432-3.208 12.502a20.11 20.11 0 0 0 6.066 2.98c.49-.664.926-1.383 1.302-2.14a13.193 13.193 0 0 1-2.052-.991c.173-.126.342-.258.506-.39a14.545 14.545 0 0 0 12.436 0c.165.132.334.264.507.39-.65.38-1.336.714-2.053.991.376.757.812 1.476 1.302 2.14a20.05 20.05 0 0 0 6.065-2.98c.506-4.587-.79-8.7-3.208-12.502zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.947-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.184 1.086 2.157 2.419 0 1.334-.947 2.419-2.157 2.419zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.947-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.184 1.086 2.157 2.419 0 1.334-.947 2.419-2.157 2.419z"/>
                        </svg>
                        Login with Discord
                    </a>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <div class="shop-header">
            <div class="container">
                <h1 class="page-title">Terms & Conditions</h1>
                <p class="page-subtitle">Please read these terms carefully before using our services</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="container">
            <div class="terms-container glass-card">
                <div class="terms-section">
                    <h2>IMPOSTER Network – Terms & Conditions</h2>
                    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: February 26, 2026</p>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-section">
                    <h3>1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
                    <p>By accessing or using IMPOSTER Network, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree to all the terms and conditions, you may not access the website or use our services.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-section">
                    <h3>2. Payment & Proof Policy</h3>
                    <ul class="terms-list">
                        <li><strong>No fake proofs</strong> – All payment proofs must be genuine and unaltered. Submitting fake proofs will result in immediate account termination without refund.</li>
                        <li><strong>No chargebacks</strong> – Chargebacks are strictly prohibited and will result in immediate ban from all IMPOSTER Network services.</li>
                        <li><strong>Proof uploads</strong> – Screenshots must clearly show the payment amount, date, and transaction ID.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-section">
                    <h3>3. Refund Policy</h3>
                    <ul class="terms-list">
                        <li><strong>Refund only if not delivered</strong> – If we fail to deliver your product within 24 hours of payment approval, you are entitled to a full refund.</li>
                        <li><strong>Digital products non-refundable</strong> – Due to the nature of digital goods, once delivered, no refunds will be issued.</li>
                        <li><strong>Service products</strong> – Services are non-refundable once work has begun.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-section">
                    <h3>4. User Conduct</h3>
                    <ul class="terms-list">
                        <li><strong>Respect staff</strong> – Disrespect towards staff members will not be tolerated and may result in a ban.</li>
                        <li><strong>No harassment</strong> – Harassment of other users or staff is strictly prohibited.</li>
                        <li><strong>No unauthorized access</strong> – Attempting to access other users' accounts or data is forbidden.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-section">
                    <h3>5. Product Delivery</h3>
                    <ul class="terms-list">
                        <li><strong>Fast support 1–24 hours</strong> – We aim to respond to all support requests within 24 hours.</li>
                        <li><strong>Delivery method</strong> – Products are delivered via Discord role assignment or direct message, depending on the product type.</li>
                        <li><strong>Delivery time</strong> – Most orders are processed within minutes of approval, but may take up to 24 hours in some cases.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-section">
                    <h3>6. Account Termination</h3>
                    <p>We reserve the right to terminate or suspend your account immediately, without prior notice or liability, for any reason whatsoever, including without limitation if you breach the Terms.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-section">
                    <h3>7. Changes to Terms</h3>
                    <p>We reserve the right to modify or replace these Terms at any time. It is your responsibility to check the Terms periodically for changes.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="terms-footer">
                    <p>By using IMPOSTER Network, you acknowledge that you have read and understood these Terms & Conditions.</p>
                    <p class="terms-signature">— IMPOSTER Network Team</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="glass-footer">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-content">
                <div class="footer-brand">
                    <span class="logo-imposter">IMPOSTER</span>
                    <span class="logo-network">NETWORK</span>
                    <p>Premium digital marketplace</p>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <a href="/">Home</a>
                    <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
                    <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
                    <a href="/history">History</a>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-copyright">
                    <p>Dev Rick • IMPOSTER Network © 2026-2027</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <style>
        .terms-container {
            padding: 3rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        
        .terms-section {
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
        
        .terms-section h2 {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .terms-section h3 {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
            padding-left: 1rem;
        }
        
        .last-updated {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .terms-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        .terms-list li {
            padding: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            background: rgba(255,0,0,0.05);
            border-radius: 6px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
        }
        
        .terms-list li strong {
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .terms-footer {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .terms-footer p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .terms-signature {
            color: var(--primary) !important;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .terms-container {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .terms-section h2 {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .terms-section h3 {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>

    <script>
        async function updateCartCount() {
            try {
                const res = await fetch('/api/cart/count');
                const data = await res.json();
                document.getElementById('cartCount').textContent = data.count;
            } catch (e) {
                console.error('Failed to update cart count');
            }
        }
        
        <% if (user) { %>
            updateCartCount();
            setInterval(updateCartCount, 30000);
        <% } %>
    </script>
</body>
</html>
